Subject: [PATCH] fix(seo): slim sitemap and noindex non-tutorial sections

Centralize indexable URLs in utils/seo-index.ts. Sitemap and IndexNow
only list home, tutorials, nav, and trust pages. Notes, research,
tools, and portfolio stay public but use noindex via routeRules and
usePageSeo robots meta for all search engines.
